# Route: guide 47 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 27 quests, 1.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Thunder Bluff, Feralas, Un'Goro Crater): Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder
# Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> Camp Mojache -> Feral Scar Vale -> Camp Mojache ->
# Grimtotem Compound -> Camp Mojache -> Ruins of Ravenwind -> Camp Mojache ->
# Frayfeather Highlands -> The Slithering Scar -> Lakkari Tar Pits.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962;
# Blazerunner 56).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing
# an Enemy's Strength (5723), Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven
# Legends (7481), Lethtendris's Web (7489).

